@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy and cookies"; ViewData["Description"] = "How the firstASPnet demonstration handles input and essential security cookies, without analytics or advertising trackers."; }
<h1>Privacy and cookies</h1><p>The demo form validates fictional project details in memory. The application does not save form input, send emails, or use advertising or analytics trackers.</p>
<h2>Essential security cookie</h2><p>Opening the demo form sets an essential anti-forgery session cookie to protect form submissions. It is not used for tracking. No optional cookies are installed, so there are no optional cookie choices to accept.</p>
<h2>Hosting and external links</h2><p>A hosting provider may retain operational access logs, including IP addresses. Configure log access and retention before deployment. Following GitHub links takes you to GitHub, which has its own privacy policy. Public issues should never contain private information.</p>
